ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  9 tricks contract is often easier than a 10 tricks contract^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  You never preempt over a preempt^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  The 5 Level Belongs to the Opponents^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  Sherlock Holmes, Bridge Detective at the table^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  If you are going to bid to a certain level, bid to it right away^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  Queen is the expert lead from AKQ^*N|


