cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have to keep East off lead to prevent a spade through. One hope is that West has 3 hearts so if I play 3 rounds of hearts West will have to win. That will give me 4 hearts, 1 spade 1 club, and 1 diamond. I still need 2 more tricks. An alternative is to hope West has the @CK and that I can lead hearts from dummy. I will try that as I need 2 more tricks.|
