UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Although second hand low is almost always right and I don't blame East for playing low on the first heart--trick 2. But given she can see @HK109 in dummy, and that I must have at least 2 hearts to open 1N playing the @HQ is a better play since it will never cost a trick even if partner has the @HA.|
PG| ***** 17 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|This was a rare case where 2nd hand high is correct. However, I would prefer that you play second hand low smoothly since that is righ 95% of the time.|
PG| ***** 18 ***** |


