mb|3H?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|There is one important bidding principle that you never preempt over a preempt. So if I choose to bid 4@S, that shows a strong hand not a weak hand. Further, I am concerned about three hearts in my hand. Meanwhile, my hand is too strong to bid only 3@S. So I am going to bid 4@S and hope for the best.|
