mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I would also pass with the North hand but if not vulnerable, I might consider opening 3@C. In 1st seat I do sometimes open 3@C with a 6-card suit (can't open a weak 2@C) when I have a singleton or void, especially if not vulnerable. But here the club suit is not great and we are vulnerable against non-vulnerable opponents.|
