UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Well played. Please note that if West bids 4@S right away, they probably play 4@S doubled losing 2 hearts, 2 diamonds, and 1 club for down 2. That is much better than us making 12 tricks in 5@H. The point is in general, if you are going to bid to a certain level, it is better you bid to it right away rather than delaying and giving the opponents more room to bid and find out what they have.|
